\newlabel{tab:consistency}{{6}{7}{Consistency between training-overlap and held-out evaluation (Qwen-2.5-7B). The held-out gap is slightly \emph {larger} (34$\times $ vs.\ 30$\times $), ruling out data memorization}{table.caption.10}{}}
